    "https://github.com/espressif/esp-bsp/tree/master/bsp/esp-box-3 (Apache-2.0, Espressif Systems), read 2026-10-18",
    "esp-box-3.h, display.h: pins, 320x240, BGR, 40 MHz, SPI display, GT911 at 0x5D or 0x14",
    "esp-box-3.c: ILI9342C init commands (minus sleep-out, display-on and address mode), mirror x+y, active-high reset shared with touch",
